{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8c4e1f2-3a5d-4c9e-9f01-cod-fixes-verify",
    "name": "IRoute — COD Fixes Verification (SH-COD-29789621)",
    "description": "Verifies all 5 COD fix patches for SH-COD-29789621 on tenant t_bb773f861f3048748c0a7f0ffbee0df6.\n\nPrerequisites:\n1. Set driver_email, driver_password, tenant_id (profile UUID) in collection variables.\n2. Run 00 Login first (saves access_token).\n3. Set job_id to shipment UUID (79da24b3-b15d-42f1-a87e-11c0143a2ff4) or run 02 Dashboard to populate.\n\nAuth: Authorization Bearer {{driver_token}} (alias: access_token after login).\nOptional: X-Tenant-ID {{tenant_id}} — JWT tenant_schema is primary for driver APIs.\n\nURLs discovered from mobile_api/urls.py (prefix /api/v1/mobile/).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "console.log('base_url:', pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url'));",
          "console.log('tenant_schema:', pm.collectionVariables.get('tenant_schema'));",
          "console.log('shipment_no:', pm.collectionVariables.get('shipment_no'));",
          "console.log('job_type:', pm.collectionVariables.get('job_type'));",
          "console.log('job_id:', pm.collectionVariables.get('job_id'));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/mobile"
    },
